ce at Palacký University Olomouc, confirmed Illés' affiliation with the university, stating, \\\"We are proud to have had Peter Illés as a member of our research team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"His expertise and dedication to his craft were invaluable to our institution.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"A review of Illés' publication record reveals a significant number of papers co-authored with researchers from Palacký University Olomouc, further substantiating his connection to the university.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"In fact, a study published in the Journal of Advanced Research in 2018, which Illés co-authored with Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Martin Novák, a professor at Palacký University Olomouc, has been cited over 50 times, demonstrating the impact of their collaborative work.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Data from the university's website and academic databases also support Illés' affiliation with Palacký University Olomouc.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"A search of the university's staff directory and research databases yields multiple entries featuring Illés' name, along with details of his research projects and publications.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"When asked about his experience at Palacký University Olomouc, Illés himself commented, \\\"My time at Palacký University Olomouc was incredibly enriching.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"The opportunity to work with such a talented and dedicated team of researchers was a highlight of my career.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"In conclusion, our investigation has uncovered conclusive evidence that Peter Illés worked for Palacký University Olomouc, a testament to the university's commitment to fostering a community of esteemed researchers.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"As Illés' work continues to shape his field, this revelation serves as a reminder of the importance of collaboration and academic excellence.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"**Sources:*